WEBVTT

00:00:00.466 --> 00:00:06.959
Your notes are everywhere. With Révise, all your revision finally lives in one place.

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:13.849
Tell Révise how you learn, then sign up with Google or an email code. No password.

00:00:15.733 --> 00:00:21.380
Drop in your PDFs, Word files, past papers, and even the YouTube video of your lecture.

00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:29.035
Révise splits your course into chapters and spots its type: calculations, definitions or dates.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:37.041
In one click, your sheet and formula sheet are ready. Every sentence links to the exact page of your course.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:46.507
Your flashcards come back just before you forget. Révise checks the whole course is covered, and rewrites the cards that trip you up.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:52.742
A diagram? Révise hides its labels, and each one becomes a card.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:01:00.248
Practise with multiple choice, including checked calculation questions, then take a timed test like on the day.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:08.301
In maths or finance, redo each exercise with new numbers, corrected step by step.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.924
Sit mock exams, graded with a realistic marking scheme.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:20.597
Explain a concept out loud: Révise tells you what's right, what's missing and what's wrong.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:26.501
A mind map to see the whole subject, a two-voice podcast to revise on the go.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:34.012
Go full screen to stay focused, and the progress bar shows how far you've got.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:38.337
Import your timetable: your plan adapts on its own.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:46.307
Enter your weightings and marks, line by line. A gauge shows the mark you need in the final, and your margin.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:49.981
Every morning, you know exactly what to study.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:57.625
Find sheets shared by your field, and see when friends are revising, without them seeing your grades.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:04.300
Coming from Anki or Quizlet? Import your cards. And from your phone, send a photo of the board.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:13.031
The AI is included, no key needed, and your courses are copied to your Google Drive. A question? Write to us in one click.

00:02:14.066 --> 00:02:23.439
Start free with Découverte. Premium unlocks everything: a three-day trial, then 39.99 euros a year or 5.99 a month. Cancel in three clicks.

00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:27.751
So, drop in your first course. Révise takes care of the rest.
